### Backlinks Summary — verplicht: target. Optioneel: include_subdomains, backlinks_status_type, internal_list_limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/backlinks-summary?target=example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Backlinks Summary — met extra opties
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/backlinks-summary?target=example.com&include_subdomains=false&backlinks_status_type=live&internal_list_limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Zonder target → 422 missing_target
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/backlinks-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Zonder PAT → 401 unauthenticated
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/backlinks-summary?target=example.com
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}